      "content": "but you're talking about living, and that just feels like taking more of the poison. like if i keep going, i'm just carrying the sickness forward. if i'm the one who stops, then the sickness stops with me. it feels almost like the only selfless thing i could actually do is just step out of the way so it can't touch anyone else. doesn't that make sense?",
